# Certificates, proofs and ledgers are OUTPUT. They are meant to be produced
# by a run and re-verified, not committed: a stale certificate in a repo is
# exactly the thing `verify` exists to catch.
out/
certs/
specs/
*.drat
ledger.jsonl

